  "sourceTitle": "[AINews] AMD buys World Labs for $8.2B, as Atlas solves sparse reconstruction problem for robotics, design and more",
  "sourceBodyHash": "8ad3e52fc9212d94a4e1b43f8679f8331069433545be43d41435fb50d7360e18",
